{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>ויאמר.</b> The lamed is added לְבַעֲבוּר, like the lamed in לְמִבְּרֵאשִׁית (1 Chronicles 15:13) and in לְאַבְשָׁלוֹם בֶּן מַעֲכָה (ibid. 3:2)." "<b>וטעם נסות אתכם.</b> Like וּלְמַעַן נַסּוֹתְךָ לְהֵיטִיבְךָ בְּאַחֲרִיתֶךָ (Deuteronomy 8:16)." "And in order that His fear be upon your faces, as written: הַיּוֹם אֲשֶׁר עָמַדְתָּ לִפְנֵי ה' אֱלֹהֶיךָ בְּחֹרֵב (ibid. 4:10)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:36:27.013296523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}